      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<section class=\"sr-journal sr-handout\"><p class=\"sr-eyebrow\">STILLROOT'S SONG &nbsp; | &nbsp; PLAYER HANDOUT</p><h1>The second voice</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>No mouth have I, yet wounds let me speak.</p>\n<p>I run when the body's walls grow weak.</p>\n<p>Within you, hidden; spilled, bright red.</p>\n<p>What keeps the living from the dead?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</section>"
